    {
        "content": "<p>if I do <code>with_reducible_and_instances exact Summable.mul_norm this this</code> it works fine, so the issue is that Lean gets stuck unfolding stuff at too high a transparency at a time it has not yet inferred all the arguments to <code>Summable.mul_norm</code>, so it tries to hard to unify the partially filled in type with the goal and runs out of heartbeats</p>",
        "id": 611940256,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1784653056
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>looking at the <code>isDefEq</code> traces, it seems to be doing the same thing many times over</p>",
        "id": 611940747,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1784653203
    },
    {
